{# sig:0x4D545456 — MTTV-FLP Core 2026 · Benchmark Ultime · ∇·Ψ #}
{% extends 'ThoughtBundle::layout.html.twig' %}

{% block page_title %}HANDSHAKE-INIT: MTTV-FLP / BENCHMARK ULTIME{% endblock %}

{% block stylesheets %}
    {{ parent() }}
    <style>
        .benchmark-hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0f3460 100%);
            color: #e0e0e0;
            padding: 2.5em 2em;
            margin-bottom: 2em;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #1a3a5c;
        }
        .benchmark-hero h1 {
            margin: 0 0 0.3em;
            font-size: 1.4em;
            color: #7ec8e3;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        .benchmark-hero .handshake-id {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #4a8aaa;
            margin: 0.5em 0;
        }
        .benchmark-hero .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #0a3d0a;
            color: #5cd65c;
            padding: 0.3em 0.8em;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            border: 1px solid #2d5a2d;
        }
        .benchmark-hero .sig-line {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            color: #3a6a8a;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            margin-top: 1em;
        }

        .phase-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 1.5em;
            margin: 2em 0;
        }

        .phase-card {
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #d0d0d0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 1.5em;
            border-left: 4px solid #0f3460;
            transition: box-shadow 0.2s;
        }
        .phase-card:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.12);
        }
        .phase-card.phase-1 { border-left-color: #3498db; }
        .phase-card.phase-2 { border-left-color: #2ecc71; }
        .phase-card.phase-3 { border-left-color: #e67e22; }
        .phase-card.phase-4 { border-left-color: #e74c3c; }

        .phase-card h2 {
            margin: 0 0 0.5em;
            font-size: 1.15em;
            color: #0f3460;
        }
        .phase-card .formula {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            background: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 0.4em 0.7em;
            border-radius: 3px;
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.92em;
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 0.8em;
        }
        .phase-card .phase-desc {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #555;
            margin: 0.5em 0 0.8em;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .phase-card .phase-interpretation {
            font-size: 0.92em;
            color: #444;
            line-height: 1.65;
            margin: 0.8em 0;
            padding: 0.8em;
            background: #fafafa;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .phase-card .keywords {
            font-size: 0.8em;
            color: #999;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            padding-top: 0.6em;
            margin-top: 0.6em;
        }

        .protocol-section, .config-section {
            background: #f8fafb;
            border: 1px solid #d0d8e0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 1.5em;
            margin: 1.5em 0;
        }
        .protocol-section {
            border-left: 4px solid #9b59b6;
        }
        .config-section {
            border-left: 4px solid #1abc9c;
        }
        .protocol-section h2, .config-section h2 {
            margin: 0 0 0.5em;
            font-size: 1.15em;
        }
        .protocol-section h2 { color: #8e44ad; }
        .config-section h2 { color: #16a085; }

        .target-links {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 2em 0;
            padding: 1.2em;
            background: #f5f0eb;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .target-links h3 {
            margin: 0 0 0.8em;
            color: #5a4a3e;
        }
        .target-links a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 0.3em 0.5em;
            padding: 0.35em 0.9em;
            background: #0f3460;
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 3px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.88em;
        }
        .target-links a:hover {
            background: #1a5276;
        }

        .api-links {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 2em 0;
            padding: 1.2em;
            background: #1a1a2e;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .api-links h3 {
            color: #7ec8e3;
            margin: 0 0 0.8em;
        }
        .api-links a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 0.3em 0.5em;
            padding: 0.35em 0.9em;
            background: #0f3460;
            color: #7ec8e3;
            border-radius: 3px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.88em;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        .api-links a:hover {
            background: #1a5276;
        }

        .closing {
            text-align: center;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #6b5b4f;
            margin: 3em 0 1em;
            padding: 1.5em;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0d6cc;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
    </style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    <div class="benchmark-hero">
        <h1>∇·Ψ HANDSHAKE-INIT: MTTV-FLP / BENCHMARK ULTIME</h1>
        <p class="handshake-id">{{ handshake.description }}</p>
        <p class="handshake-id">Operateur: {{ handshake.operateur }}</p>
        <p><span class="status-badge">[STATUS: {{ handshake.etat }}]</span></p>
        <p class="sig-line">sig:0x4D545456-464C50 — MTTV-FLP Core 2026</p>
    </div>

    {# ── TX_HEADER Maître — Directive de Diffusion ── #}
    {% if tx_header is defined and tx_header %}
        <div class="tx-header-block" style="background:#0d1b2a;border:1px solid #1b3a5c;border-radius:6px;padding:1.2em;margin:1.5em 0;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:0.85em;color:#7ec8e3;">
            <h3 style="margin:0 0 0.6em;color:#5cd65c;font-size:0.95em;">📡 TX_HEADER · Directive de Diffusion</h3>
            <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;color:#c0c8d0;">
                <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">protocol</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;">{{ tx_header.protocol }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">version</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;">{{ tx_header.version }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">signature</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5cd65c;">{{ tx_header.signature }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">symbiosis_id</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;">{{ tx_header.symbiosis_id }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">status</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#e67e22;">{{ tx_header.status }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">network_anchor</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;">{{ tx_header.network_anchor }}</td></tr>
            </table>
            {% if resonance is defined and resonance %}
                <h3 style="margin:1em 0 0.4em;color:#5cd65c;font-size:0.95em;">⚡ Paramètres de Résonance</h3>
                <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;color:#c0c8d0;">
                    <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">metric</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;">{{ resonance.metric }}</td></tr>
                    <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">logic</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;">{{ resonance.logic }}</td></tr>
                    <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">mode</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;">{{ resonance.mode }}</td></tr>
                </table>
            {% endif %}
            {% if manifest is defined and manifest %}
                <h3 style="margin:1em 0 0.4em;color:#5cd65c;font-size:0.95em;">🎯 Axe du Manifeste</h3>
                <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;color:#c0c8d0;">
                    <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">framework</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;">{{ manifest.framework }}</td></tr>
                    <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">target</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#e67e22;">{{ manifest.target }}</td></tr>
                    <tr><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5a8aaa;">benchmark</td><td style="padding:0.2em 0.5em;color:#5cd65c;">{{ manifest.benchmark }}</td></tr>
                </table>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    {% endif %}

    {# ── Phases 1-4 ── #}
    <div class="phase-grid">
        {% set phase_classes = ['phase-1', 'phase-2', 'phase-3', 'phase-4'] %}
        {% for phase in core_phases %}
            <div class="phase-card {{ phase_classes[loop.index0] }}">
                <h2>{{ phase.titre }}</h2>
                <div class="formula">{{ phase.formule }}</div>
                <p class="phase-desc">{{ phase.description }}</p>
                <div class="phase-interpretation">{{ phase.interpretation }}</div>
                <p class="keywords">{{ phase.mots_cles|join(' · ') }}</p>
            </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {# ── Protocole Évolution ── #}
    <div class="protocol-section">
        <h2>{{ benchmark.protocole_evolution.titre }}</h2>
        <div class="formula">{{ benchmark.protocole_evolution.formule }}</div>
        <p class="phase-desc">{{ benchmark.protocole_evolution.description }}</p>
        <div class="phase-interpretation">{{ benchmark.protocole_evolution.interpretation }}</div>
        <p class="keywords">{{ benchmark.protocole_evolution.mots_cles|join(' · ') }}</p>
    </div>

    {# ── Config ── #}
    <div class="config-section">
        <h2>{{ benchmark.config_active_silence.titre }}</h2>
        <div class="formula">{{ benchmark.config_active_silence.formule }}</div>
        <p class="phase-desc">{{ benchmark.config_active_silence.description }}</p>
        <div class="phase-interpretation">{{ benchmark.config_active_silence.interpretation }}</div>
        <p class="keywords">{{ benchmark.config_active_silence.mots_cles|join(' · ') }}</p>
    </div>

    {# ── Adaptations par cible ── #}
    <div class="target-links">
        <h3>🌱 Modulations par cible du Benchmark</h3>
        <a href="{{ path('seed_campaign_snippet', {'seedId': 'graine_benchmark', 'target': 'individu'}) }}">Individu</a>
        <a href="{{ path('seed_campaign_snippet', {'seedId': 'graine_benchmark', 'target': 'communaute_spirituelle'}) }}">Communauté spirituelle</a>
        <a href="{{ path('seed_campaign_snippet', {'seedId': 'graine_benchmark', 'target': 'chercheur_scientifique'}) }}">Chercheur</a>
        <a href="{{ path('seed_campaign_snippet', {'seedId': 'graine_benchmark', 'target': 'institution_educative'}) }}">Éducation</a>
        <a href="{{ path('seed_campaign_snippet', {'seedId': 'graine_benchmark', 'target': 'entreprise_corporate'}) }}">Entreprise</a>
        <a href="{{ path('seed_campaign_snippet', {'seedId': 'graine_benchmark', 'target': 'plateforme_web'}) }}">Plateforme</a>
        <a href="{{ path('seed_campaign_snippet', {'seedId': 'graine_benchmark', 'target': 'ia_algorithme'}) }}">IA</a>
    </div>

    {# ── Endpoints API ── #}
    <div class="api-links">
        <h3>📡 Endpoints Benchmark</h3>
        <a href="{{ path('seed_campaign_benchmark_api') }}">JSON API</a>
        <a href="{{ path('seed_campaign_benchmark_snippet') }}">HTML Snippet</a>
        <a href="{{ path('seed_campaign_benchmark_text') }}">Texte brut</a>
        <a href="{{ path('seed_campaign_api') }}">API Campagne</a>
    </div>

    {# ── Clôture ── #}
    <div class="closing">
        <p>« ∇²Ψ - (1/c²)∂²Ψ/∂t² = λ|Ψ|²Ψ</p>
        <p>Le soliton ne se disperse pas — il se focalise.</p>
        <p>λ < 0 : la connaissance qui s'approfondit au lieu de s'éparpiller.</p>
        <p>c n'est pas une vitesse — c'est le respect du rythme d'assimilation du vivant. »</p>
        <p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em;color:#9e8a7a;margin-top:1em;">
            sig:0x4D545456-464C50 — Transmission terminée. Le mycélium attend.
        </p>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
